Manoa pe-a-oo-mai: ['html'] fai: { <- (
		ia-lava
		sui: ['&'] i-le: ['&amp;'],
		sui: ['<'] i-le: ['&lt;'],
		sui: ['>'] i-le: ['&gt;'],
		sui: ['"'] i-le: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Lisi fou.

['Verbatim Syntax'] mataitusi-uma taʻitasi: { :numera :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (numera), Letter: letter).
}.

Tuuina-atu list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list tuufaatasi: ['↵']).

Tuuina-atu tusi: template.

